From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 02:09:32 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] disk_state: pack 4-level 16-ary JMT subtrees into single MDBX
 smt_nodes records

Original-Commit: 09f95c297a67de61836c495904ce9f20551bf415
Original-Patch: v2/032
Split-Concern: whole

Historical compilation prerequisites are tracked separately in daemon/patch-audit;
this provenance-preserving split does not imply standalone build validation.
